sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Worker Client
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Leader as Raft Leader
    participant Quorum as Raft Majority Quorum
    participant FSM as Deterministic FSM

    Client->>GW: POST /v1/locks/release {resource_name, owner_id, fencing_token: T}
    GW->>Leader: Proxy Release Command to Raft Leader

    Leader->>Quorum: Replicate ReleaseLockCommand across Cluster
    Quorum-->>Leader: Replicated to Majority Quorum (2/3)

    Leader->>FSM: Commit & Apply Release to FSM
    Note over FSM: 1. Verify Active Lock Exists<br/>2. Match Owner ID == Active Owner<br/>3. Match Fencing Token == Active Token T<br/>4. Remove Lock Record<br/>5. Preserve Resource HighestToken = T<br/>6. Record History Entry

    FSM-->>Leader: Release Success
    Leader-->>GW: HTTP 200 OK {success: true}
    GW-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK {released: true}

    Note over FSM: Resource is now FREE.<br/>Next acquisition by ANY worker<br/>will receive FencingToken = T + 1

